{"displayStem":"운동 중 목에서 소리가 나는 25세 여자가 반복 폐활량검사를 받았다. 세 번 모두 밀폐와 최대 노력이 적절했고 기침·튜브 폐쇄는 없었다. 그림은 그중 두 회의 측정 모형이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 독립 작성 모의자료"},{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C10 c10-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"c10-visual\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"배출된 용적 (L)와 유량 (L/s; 호기 +, 흡기 −)\"><text x=\"270\" y=\"22\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1회</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"49\">유량 (L/s; 호기 +, 흡기 −)</text><path d=\"M70 60V260H490\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\"></path><path d=\"M70 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"70\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M280 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"280\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2.5</text><path d=\"M490 260v5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"490\" y=\"284\" text-anchor=\"middle\">5</text><path d=\"M65 260h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"end\">-6</text><path d=\"M65 174.28571428571428h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"179.28571428571428\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M65 60h5\" stroke=\"black\"></path><text x=\"60\" y=\"65\" text-anchor=\"end\">8</text><path d=\"M70 174.28571428571428H490\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 4\"></path><polyline points=\"70,174.28571428571428 86.8,74.28571428571428 120.4,88.57142857142858 170.8,108.57142857142858 238,127.14285714285714 322,148.57142857142856 406,174.28571428571428 380.8,195.71428571428572 322,198.57142857142858 238,198.57142857142858 154,197.14285714285714 86.8,194.28571428571428 70,174.28571428571428\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"></polyline><circle cx=\"70\" cy=\"174.28571428571428\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"86.8\" cy=\"74.28571428571428\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"120.4\" cy=\"88.57142857142858\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"><